				<r3d:description language="eng">CLARINO Bergen  Center repository is the repository of CLARINO, the Norwegian infrastructure project . Its goal is to implement the Norwegian part of CLARIN. The ultimate aim is to make existing and future language resources easily accessible for researchers and to bring eScience to humanities disciplines.
The repository includes INESS  the Norwegian Infrastructure for the Exploration of Syntax and Semantics. This infrastructure provides access to treebanks, which are databases of syntactically and semantically annotated sentences.</r3d:description>
